{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56809","headline":"泰山猎人石室遇仙闻董双成奏《云和》笙词 · 不详","name":"泰山猎人石室遇仙闻董双成奏《云和》笙词","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"淅沥复悠溶，诸天乐所宗。\n愔愔形类凤，冉冉势从龙。\n片触峻嶒碎，声飘列缺重。\n不辞歌一曲，此会信难逢。\n（《灯下闲谈》卷下《猎猪遇仙》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"不详","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56809.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56809","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}